# Intentionally empty of directives - see Backend/uploads/.htaccess's
# comment for the full history: both Require all denied/Order+Deny and
# RemoveHandler/RemoveType were tried here and both 500'd live on this
# host's AllowOverride restrictions (confirmed 2026-09-24). No directive
# this file could hold is safe to assume works on this host, so it's
# left empty rather than guessing again.
#
# This holds raw in-progress upload chunks that have not been
# content-validated yet (see ChunkUploadController). Nothing in this app
# ever generates or links to a public URL under this folder, and chunk
# filenames are uniqid()-based inside a per-user subdirectory - not
# linked, not predictable, not the primary defense either way.
